	<h2>Google Gemini</h2>
			<p1>
				Google Gemini is Google’s Generative AI Assistant and chat bot platform. 
				It was designed to compete with the likes of ChatGPT. The main difference
				is that its is integrated deeply into all of the other services that
				Google offers likes Gmail and Docs to name a few. Gemini is a 
				multimodal AI there fore it can understand and generate different
				forms of information. This information includes text, images, audio, code 
				and video. It can manage processes across all of their services without 
				having to switch back and fourth between applications. Gemini can be described
				 as an AI that covers almost anything, especially if you use their other services.
			</p1>
		<h2>Popular Uses</h2>
			<ul>
            	<li>Deep Research</li>
         		<li>AI Assitants (Gems)</li>
            	<li>Long-Context Processing</li>
            	<li>Image and Video Generation</li>
